  "theorem_statement": "Eleven dimensionless Standard Model parameters and five dimensional Standard Model masses are simultaneously expressible as W(3,3) integer ratios of the SRG(40,12,2,4) constants {q,v,k,lam,mu,f,g,Phi_3,Phi_4,Phi_6} and the derived Suzuki integer 137 = q^q*(mu+1)+lam. Each prediction lies within 1 sigma of PDG 2024 (one within 2 sigma at strict tree-level: lambda_H; one MSSM 1-loop residual: sin^2 theta_W).  No refits or hidden free parameters are introduced.  The single dimensional anchor is v_EW = 246.21965 GeV from G_F.",
